WEBVTT

00:03:58.503 --> 00:04:01.374
a conflict of interest.

00:04:01.374 --> 00:04:03.890
The third point is,

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:06.805
the rating agencies are not really telling us

00:04:06.805 --> 00:04:09.443
how they are coming up with their ratings,

00:04:09.443 --> 00:04:11.283
but in this day and age,

00:04:11.283 --> 00:04:13.159
you can't even sell a candy bar

00:04:13.159 --> 00:04:16.207
without listing everything that's inside.

00:04:16.207 --> 00:04:19.891
But for ratings, a crucial element of our economy,

00:04:19.891 --> 00:04:21.560
we really do not know

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.042
what all the different ingredients are.

00:04:24.042 --> 00:04:25.988
We are allowing the rating agencies

00:04:25.988 --> 00:04:28.690
to be intransparent about their work,

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.752
and we need to change this.